{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamics-processing","title":"动态处理与压缩器原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/dynamics-processing","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态处理与压缩器原理\">动态处理与压缩器原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动态处理器把音乐演奏的自然动态范围压缩到播放环境能够承载的范围。几个概念构成全篇的骨架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>动态范围</strong>：最响与最轻之间的响度差，自然演奏可达 70–80 dB，而播放环境往往远低于此。</li>\n<li><strong>四类处理器</strong>：压缩器（向下压缩）、限幅器（极端压缩）、扩展器（向下扩展）、噪声门（极端扩展）。</li>\n<li><strong>五个核心参数</strong>：阈值、压缩比、启动时间（Attack）、释放时间（Release）、膝部（Knee）。</li>\n<li><strong>电路拓扑决定&quot;性格&quot;</strong>：VCA 精确、FET 快速有攻击性、Opto 自然平滑、Vari-Mu 温暖黏合。</li>\n<li><strong>高级技法</strong>：并行压缩、Sidechain 触发、多段压缩、Mid/Side 压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键权衡是&quot;控制力&quot;与&quot;自然度&quot;：更快的 Attack、更高的 Ratio 带来更强的控制，但也更易抹平瞬态与律动感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态范围控制的必要性\">动态范围控制的必要性</h2><p>动态范围（Dynamic Range）是音频中最响与最轻之间的响度差异。人类音乐演奏的自然动态范围可达 70-80 dB（从 ppp 到 fff），但播放环境（汽车、耳机、手机）的有效动态范围远低于此。动态处理器的作用就是将过大的动态范围压缩到适合播放介质与听觉环境的范围内。</p>\n<p>四种基本动态处理器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理器</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>工作方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>压缩器 (Compressor)</td>\n<td>降低超过阈值的信号</td>\n<td>向下压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限幅器 (Limiter)</td>\n<td>硬性阻止信号超过天花板</td>\n<td>极端压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展器 (Expander)</td>\n<td>降低低于阈值的信号</td>\n<td>向下扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声门 (Gate)</td>\n<td>完全关断低于阈值的信号</td>\n<td>极端扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;动态处理器&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;压缩器&lt;br/&gt;减小动态范围&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;限幅器&lt;br/&gt;设置绝对天花板&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;扩展器&lt;br/&gt;增大动态范围&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;噪声门&lt;br/&gt;消除底噪&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"动态处理器\"] --&gt; B[\"压缩器&lt;br/&gt;减小动态范围\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"限幅器&lt;br/&gt;设置绝对天花板\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"扩展器&lt;br/&gt;增大动态范围\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"噪声门&lt;br/&gt;消除底噪\"]</pre><h2 id=\"压缩器的核心参数\">压缩器的核心参数</h2><p>压缩器通过五个核心参数精确控制动态行为：</p>\n<p><strong>阈值（Threshold）</strong>：压缩开始作用的电平。信号低于阈值时不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>压缩比（Ratio）</strong>：信号超过阈值后，输入电平变化与输出电平变化的比值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ratio </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>输入增加 4dB，输出仅增加 1dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ratio } 4:1 \\Rightarrow \\text{输入增加 4dB，输出仅增加 1dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ratio </span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入增加</span><span class=\"mord\"> 4dB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，输出仅增加</span><span class=\"mord\"> 1dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>启动时间（Attack）</strong>：信号超过阈值后，压缩达到全量所需时间。快 Attack 捕捉瞬态，慢 Attack 允许瞬态通过。</p>\n<p><strong>释放时间（Release）</strong>：信号回到阈值以下后，压缩恢复的时间。</p>\n<p><strong>膝部（Knee）</strong>：阈值附近过渡的平滑程度。硬膝（Hard Knee）在阈值处突然开始压缩，软膝（Soft Knee）在阈值前后逐渐过渡。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增益衰减 (GR)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Threshold</mtext></mrow><mtext>Ratio</mtext></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Threshold</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增益衰减 (GR)} = \\frac{\\text{Input} - \\text{Threshold}}{\\text{Ratio}} - (\\text{Input} - \\text{Threshold})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增益衰减</span><span class=\"mord\"> (GR)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ratio</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Threshold</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Threshold</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>快速设置</th>\n<th>慢速设置</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Attack</td>\n<td>0.1-5 ms</td>\n<td>20-100 ms</td>\n<td>瞬态保留程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Release</td>\n<td>50-100 ms</td>\n<td>200-500 ms</td>\n<td>律动呼吸感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratio</td>\n<td>1.5:1 - 3:1</td>\n<td>温和压缩</td>\n<td>透明控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratio</td>\n<td>4:1 - 10:1</td>\n<td>强烈压缩</td>\n<td>明显动态变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratio</td>\n<td>20:1 - ∞:1</td>\n<td>限幅</td>\n<td>硬性限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"压缩器电路拓扑\">压缩器电路拓扑</h2><p>不同电路设计赋予压缩器不同的&quot;性格&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>VCA 压缩</strong>：电压控制放大器，精确、透明、快速。代表：SSL G-Bus、API 2500。</p>\n<p><strong>FET 压缩</strong>：场效应管模拟，具有&quot;攻击性&quot;色彩。代表：Universal Audio 1176（极快 Attack）。</p>\n<p><strong>光电压缩</strong>（Opto）：光学元件控制，自然的 program-dependent 响应。代表：LA-2A、CL 1B。</p>\n<p><strong>Vari-Mu（变μ管）</strong>：电子管增益控制，温暖、黏合。代表：Fairchild 670、Manley Vari-Mu。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 压缩器性格光谱&#10;        A[&quot;VCA&lt;br/&gt;精确透明&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;FET&lt;br/&gt;快速攻击性&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;Opto&lt;br/&gt;自然平滑&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;Vari-Mu&lt;br/&gt;温暖黏合&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 压缩器性格光谱\n        A[\"VCA&lt;br/&gt;精确透明\"] --&gt; B[\"FET&lt;br/&gt;快速攻击性\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"Opto&lt;br/&gt;自然平滑\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"Vari-Mu&lt;br/&gt;温暖黏合\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"并行压缩与高级技法\">并行压缩与高级技法</h2><p><strong>并行压缩</strong>（Parallel Compression/New York Compression）：将原始未压缩信号与重度压缩的信号混合。这保留了原始瞬态的自然感，同时抬升了低电平细节。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>compress</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y[n] = \\alpha \\cdot x[n] + (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\text{compress}(x[n])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compress</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Sidechain 压缩</strong>：压缩器的检测信号来自外部输入而非处理信号本身。经典应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>底鼓触发 Bass 压缩 → 低频不冲突</li>\n<li>人声触发乐器压缩 → 人声自动&quot;让位&quot;</li>\n<li>EDM 的 pumping 效果（底鼓触发全混 sidechain）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多段压缩</strong>（Multiband Compression）：将频谱分为多个频段，每段独立压缩。避免低频大动态影响高频细节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并行压缩</td>\n<td>干湿混合</td>\n<td>鼓组、人声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sidechain</td>\n<td>外部触发</td>\n<td>Bass ducking、EDM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多段压缩</td>\n<td>频段独立</td>\n<td>母带处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mid/Side 压缩</td>\n<td>中央/两侧独立</td>\n<td>立体声宽度控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"响度战争与现代标准\">响度战争与现代标准</h2><p>&quot;响度战争&quot;（Loudness War）是指唱片工业从 1990 年代开始过度使用压缩和限幅来提高音乐的平均响度的趋势——以牺牲动态范围为代价换取&quot;更响 = 更好&quot;的错觉。</p>\n<p>2020 年代，流媒体平台的响度归一化（Loudness Normalization）终结了响度战争的逻辑——Spotify（-14 LUFS）、Apple Music（-16 LUFS）、YouTube（-14 LUFS）都会自动调整音量，使得过度压缩不再带来响度优势，反而暴露了动态损失。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LUFS (Loudness Units relative to Full Scale)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>integrated loudness measurement</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LUFS (Loudness Units relative to Full Scale)} = \\text{integrated loudness measurement}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LUFS (Loudness Units relative to Full Scale)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">integrated loudness measurement</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2024-2025 年的制作趋势回归了更大的动态范围（-10 到 -14 LUFS 之间），配合 True Peak 限幅确保数字不削波。Apple 的 Spatial Audio 混音指南甚至建议目标响度降低到 -18 LUFS 以保留空间感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>动态处理器的目标是把演奏的自然动态范围适配到播放环境。压缩器的五个参数——阈值、Ratio、Attack、Release、Knee——共同决定其行为，其中 Attack 与 Release 是塑造瞬态与律动感的关键。不同电路拓扑赋予压缩器不同的听觉&quot;性格&quot;，VCA、FET、Opto、Vari-Mu 各有典型应用。并行压缩、Sidechain、多段与 Mid/Side 等高级技法，把单一压缩器扩展为整套动态控制工具链。响度归一化的普及终结了响度战争的逻辑，当代趋势回到更大动态范围并辅以 True Peak 限幅。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态处理与压缩器原理","id":"动态处理与压缩器原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动态范围控制的必要性","id":"动态范围控制的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩器的核心参数","id":"压缩器的核心参数"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩器电路拓扑","id":"压缩器电路拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"并行压缩与高级技法","id":"并行压缩与高级技法"},{"level":2,"text":"响度战争与现代标准","id":"响度战争与现代标准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"EQ 均衡器与滤波器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/eq-filters"},"next":{"title":"混响与空间效果算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/reverb-spatial"}}